      "observed": "The netlist contains no component with reference C3. The component list includes C1, C2, C4, C5, C6, C8, C9, C10, C11, C12, C13, C14, C17, C18, and C7, but no C3.",
      "expected": "Spec section 4 lists C3 as a 100 nF VCC–GND local bypass capacitor.",
